# The plotname is the half that matters.  A run whose analysis did not
# produce data still writes a well-formed rawfile -- doc/codex/issues/0059 --
# and it is 'Plotname: constants' with the twelve physical constants in it.
# So 'present' alone would be satisfied by exactly the artefact the guard
# exists to prevent; the grep is what makes this a negative control.
present sim-status-guard-ok.raw
grep sim-status-guard-ok.raw Plotname: Operating Point
